WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.544 --> 00:00:18.490
Mr. stood near the black box and reached into his hat.

2
00:00:19.491 --> 00:00:20.931
He pulled out several swords.

3
00:00:21.892 --> 00:00:23.633
He looked into the camera and smiled.

4
00:00:23.653 --> 00:00:27.774
"Say good-bye to Rocket Girl," he said.

5
00:00:29.175 --> 00:00:31.616
Mr. Presto slowly pushed a sword through the box.

6
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.642
Shlink! "Aah!"

7
00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:35.702
Mara cried.

8
00:00:36.663 --> 00:00:38.865
Mr. Presto stuck another sword through the box.

9
00:00:39.545 --> 00:00:41.867
Shlink! "Oh no!"

10
00:00:42.287 --> 00:00:43.268
cried Detective Smith.

11
00:00:44.629 --> 00:00:45.629
One by one, Mr.

12
00:00:45.669 --> 00:00:47.791
Presto stuck all the swords through the box.

13
00:00:48.812 --> 00:00:50.493
When he was done, he opened the box.

14
00:00:52.474 --> 00:00:53.275
It was empty.

15
00:00:54.776 --> 00:00:57.878
A hole was burned through the back.

16
00:00:58.519 --> 00:00:59.679
"Aargh!" cried Mr.

17
00:00:59.719 --> 00:01:02.541
Presto. "Rocket Girl escaped!"

18
00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:05.143
Mr. Presto looked at the camera.

19
00:01:06.564 --> 00:01:08.365
"Never mind.

20
00:01:09.346 --> 00:01:13.729
It's time to make all the money in Metro City Bank disappear!"

21
00:01:18.632 --> 00:01:20.293
no!" cried Detective Smith.

22
00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.435
"Where's Rocket Girl?"

23
00:01:23.696 --> 00:01:25.757
Mr. Presto walked into Metro City Bank.

24
00:01:26.658 --> 00:01:27.758
There was a line of people.

25
00:01:28.679 --> 00:01:29.700
He waved his wand.

26
00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:32.398
"One, two, three Presto!"

27
00:01:33.358 --> 00:01:35.380
Poof! All the people disappeared.

28
00:01:36.301 --> 00:01:38.222
A second later they appeared outside the bank.

29
00:01:38.242 --> 00:01:40.364
"What just happened?"

30
00:01:40.724 --> 00:01:41.245
said a man.

31
00:01:42.326 --> 00:01:44.067
Inside, the bank teller looked at Mr.

32
00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:47.630
Presto. "Hello, sir," she said.

33
00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:50.813
"How can I help—" Poof!

34
00:01:51.573 --> 00:01:52.474
She disappeared.

35
00:01:53.635 --> 00:01:55.216
Mr. Presto went behind the counter.

36
00:01:56.637 --> 00:01:57.738
He stood in front of a door.

37
00:01:58.479 --> 00:01:59.540
It was big and round.

38
00:02:00.564 --> 00:02:01.865
It was made of solid metal.

39
00:02:02.786 --> 00:02:04.267
Mr. Presto looked at the camera.

40
00:02:05.147 --> 00:02:08.269
"And now, the moment we've all been waiting for.

41
00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:12.412
Behind this door is a huge pile of money.

42
00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.514
And it's all going to be mine!"

43
00:02:16.575 --> 00:02:18.316
Mr. Presto raised his wand.

44
00:02:18.336 --> 00:02:22.679
"One, two, three, presto!"

45
00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:24.841
The door swung open.

46
00:02:26.782 --> 00:02:29.564
Mr. Presto looked in and saw—Rocket Girl!

47
00:02:33.336 --> 00:02:34.978
Terrell, Mara, and Jack cheered.

48
00:02:35.978 --> 00:02:37.340
Roxy ripped the wand from Mr.

49
00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.180
Presto's hand.

50
00:02:39.101 --> 00:02:40.482
Mr. Presto was confused.

51
00:02:40.502 --> 00:02:42.484
"How did you—?"

52
00:02:42.504 --> 00:02:46.047
"There will be no more magic for you, Mr.

53
00:02:46.107 --> 00:02:47.729
Presto!" said Roxy.

54
00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.411
She held the wand up with both hands.

55
00:02:50.671 --> 00:02:51.952
And she snapped it in half.

56
00:02:52.793 --> 00:02:55.696
Crack! "No!"

57
00:02:56.056 --> 00:02:56.576
cried Mr.

58
00:02:56.616 --> 00:03:00.440
Presto. Detective Smith breathed a sigh of relief.

59
00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.182
"Hurray!" shouted the Mighty Man actor.

60
00:03:04.202 --> 00:03:07.044
"Yay!" shouted Mara.

61
00:03:08.145 --> 00:03:10.306
She, Jack, and Terrell jumped up and down.

62
00:03:10.326 --> 00:03:13.549
"That was the best show ever!"

63
00:03:13.929 --> 00:03:14.549
said Terrell.

64
00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:16.871
"Yeah," said Jack.

65
00:03:16.891 --> 00:03:21.574
"I like Mighty Man, but Rocket Girl is a real superhero!"

66
00:03:27.638 --> 00:03:29.600
Several minutes later Roxy walked in.

67
00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.421
"Hey, guys!"

68
00:03:31.702 --> 00:03:32.143
she said.

69
00:03:32.163 --> 00:03:33.605
"I'm back!"

70
00:03:34.546 --> 00:03:36.969
Terrell looked at the TV and then at Roxy.

71
00:03:37.891 --> 00:03:39.413
He gave her a suspicious look.

72
00:03:40.434 --> 00:03:42.918
Roxy just smiled.

73
00:03:42.938 --> 00:03:45.161
"So did I miss anything?"
